# Viaduct OSS Trivy ignore file.
#
# Each entry MUST be preceded by a comment block including:
#   - GitHub handle of the suppressor and ISO date
#   - Reason (link to upstream issue, internal triage doc, or short justification)
# Use the `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` suffix to set automatic expiry (≤ 90 days from suppression).
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Example (delete on first real entry):
# geovanne_duarte 2026-05-26: false-positive — only affects guava server module
# which Viaduct doesn't bundle. https://github.com/google/guava/issues/XXXX
# CVE-XXXX-YYYYY exp:2026-08-24
